# Guarded-patcher rollback backups (2026-07-11): the existing *.bak rule matches only
# files ending exactly in '.bak'; it misses suffixed variants like .w1bak / .w2bak /
# .w2b1bak / .w2b2bak (guarded-edit backups) and .bak2 .. .bak9 (numbered backups).
# These patterns catch both so rollback backups are never accidentally committed.
*.w[0-9]*bak
*.bak[0-9]
